<https://w3id.org/lcanet/actor#Agent> rdf:type owl:Class .


###  https://w3id.org/lcanet/core#Interpretation
:Interpretation rdf:type owl:Class ;
                owl:disjointWith :LcaModel ,
                                 :LifeCycleStage ,
                                 :Scope ;
                rdfs:comment "The Interpretation class connects the LCA model to the Impact Assessment module, representing the analysis and interpretation of results to support decision-making, conclusions, and recommendations." ;
                rdfs:label "Interpretation" .


###  https://w3id.org/lcanet/core#LcaModel
:LcaModel rdf:type owl:Class ;
          owl:disjointWith :LifeCycleStage ,
                           :Scope ,
                           <https://w3id.org/lcanet/ia#LcaResult> ;
          rdfs:comment """The LCA model class represents a complete Life Cycle Assessment instance within the LCAnet ontology network. 
Its instance ID encapsulates all aspects of the LCA study, linking to scope, goal, life cycle stages, and interpretation results.""" ;
          rdfs:label "LCA Model" .


###  https://w3id.org/lcanet/core#LifeCycleStage
:LifeCycleStage rdf:type owl:Class ;
                owl:disjointWith :Scope ,
                                 <https://w3id.org/lcanet/ia#LcaResult> ;
                rdfs:comment "The LifeCycle stage class enumerates the standard stages of a product or service life cycle, providing an exhaustive list of the five possible stages for classification and analysis within the LCA." ;
                rdfs:label "Life Cycle Stage" .


###  https://w3id.org/lcanet/core#Scope
:Scope rdf:type owl:Class ;
       owl:disjointWith <https://w3id.org/lcanet/ia#LcaResult> ;
       rdfs:comment "The Scope class captures the boundaries and context of an LCA study, including spatial and temporal aspects, functional unit, system boundaries, and assumptions, and a reference flow. Each element is represented via data properties connecting the Scope class to its corresponding values." ;
       rdfs:label "Scope" .


###  https://w3id.org/lcanet/ia#CharacterizationFactor
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/ia#CharacterizationFactor> rdf:type owl:Class .


###  https://w3id.org/lcanet/ia#CharacterizationModel
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/ia#CharacterizationModel> rdf:type owl:Class .


###  https://w3id.org/lcanet/ia#ImpactCategory
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/ia#ImpactCategory> rdf:type owl:Class .


###  https://w3id.org/lcanet/ia#ImpactCategoryIndicator
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/ia#ImpactCategoryIndicator> rdf:type owl:Class .


###  https://w3id.org/lcanet/ia#LcaResult
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/ia#LcaResult> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                       owl:equivalentClass [ rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                             owl:unionOf ( [ owl:intersectionOf ( <https://w3id.org/lcanet/ia#LcaResult>
                                                                                                  [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                                                    owl:onProperty :hasFlowCategory ;
                                                                                                    owl:someValuesFrom <https://w3id.org/lcanet/activity#FlowTag>
                                                                                                  ]
                                                                                                ) ;
                                                                             rdf:type owl:Class
                                                                           ]
                                                                           [ owl:intersectionOf ( <https://w3id.org/lcanet/ia#LcaResult>
                                                                                                  [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                                                    owl:onProperty <https://w3id.org/lcanet/ia#hasIC> ;
                                                                                                    owl:someValuesFrom <https://w3id.org/lcanet/ia#ImpactCategory>
                                                                                                  ]
                                                                                                ) ;
                                                                             rdf:type owl:Class
                                                                           ]
                                                                         )
                                                           ] .


